  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_01",
      "hash64": "9A4E50C60C312BAA",
      "text": "看，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n深钵的风车！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_02",
      "hash64": "9A4E4FC60C3129F7",
      "text": "它迎着吹过这帕底亚的风，\\n缓慢而有力地旋转着……[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_03",
      "hash64": "9A4E4EC60C312844",
      "text": "我从那里跳下来，\\n出现在道馆挑战者的面前，\\r\\n会为对战增添更多的深度！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "84589E7D23A65B06",
      "text": "原来如此！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "84589D7D23A65953",
      "text": "是这样啊……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_04",
      "hash64": "9A4E4DC60C312691",
      "text": "不愧是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n你能理解我啊！哈～哈、哈、哈！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_05",
      "hash64": "9A4E4CC60C3124DE",
      "text": "不过这次即使不弄疼我的腿也能\\n诞生出最高杰作，所以就免了吧！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_06",
      "hash64": "9A4E4BC60C31232B",
      "text": "我们两个都擅于表现。\\n应该无需多言了吧。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_07",
      "hash64": "9A4E4AC60C312178",
      "text": "来，你准备好了吧！？\\n合作……开始！！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_08",
      "hash64": "9A4E49C60C311FC5",
      "text": "阁下能在对战中柔顺地改变色调！\\n这是具有独创性的渐变！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_09",
      "hash64": "9A4E48C60C311E12",
      "text": "在强悍的同时又不失温柔！\\n这妙不可言的对照，让我心服口服！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_10",
      "hash64": "9A4ACBC60C2E13D4",
      "text": "和阁下的对战真好……\\n这让我回想起\\r\\n刚投身艺术时的初心。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_11",
      "hash64": "9A4ACCC60C2E1587",
      "text": "对了，你身上还有\\n替首席冠军视察的任务啊。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_12",
      "hash64": "9A4ACDC60C2E173A",
      "text": "好，视察的结果\\n你就随便报告一下吧。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_13",
      "hash64": "9A4ACEC60C2E18ED",
      "text": "啊啊，灵感涌上来了。\\n停不住……停不住啊……！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_14",
      "hash64": "9A4AC7C60C2E0D08",
      "text": "我要去创作新的作品，\\n就此失陪了！再会！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
